|--------------|-------------|-------------|-------------|------------|-------------|
|Density       | 0.02, 0.679  | 0.08, 0.125  | 0.05, 0.326  | 0.19, <0.001| 0.07, 0.208  |
|Extension     |-0.01, 0.833  | 0.03, 0.536  | 0.11, 0.033  | 0.07, 0.199 | 0.30, <0.001 |
